THIRD-PARTY BENCHMARK DATA
---------------------------
The files under instances/taillard_pfsp/*.fsp are NOT authored by this repository.
They are the permutation flow-shop benchmark instances published in:

    Taillard, E. (1993). Benchmarks for basic scheduling problems.
    European Journal of Operational Research, 64(2), 278-285.
    https://doi.org/10.1016/0377-2217(93)90182-M

Taillard released these instances for free academic use and they are widely mirrored.
They are redistributed here unmodified, purely for the reproducibility of the thesis's
external-validity experiments, and remain subject to their original terms. Anyone using
them must cite Taillard (1993), not this repository.
